      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The night sky guards The Athenaeum. I count 12 souls, each living in their own way. Nearby, Fern Handsteady the philosopher moves with purpose. rolling clouds roll overhead. Autumn dresses the land in amber and rust.</description>
